sequenceDiagram
    participant Employee
    participant EmployeePortalController
    participant RequestService
    participant Database
    participant HRHead
    participant RequestsController
    participant BusinessOwner
    participant OwnerController

    Employee->>EmployeePortalController: POST /employee/requests
    EmployeePortalController->>RequestService: createRequest(employeeId, type, detail)
    alt Leave request - insufficient balance
        RequestService-->>EmployeePortalController: throw InsufficientLeaveBalanceException
        EmployeePortalController-->>Employee: Show error
    end
    RequestService->>Database: INSERT request (status=Pending)
    RequestService->>Database: INSERT request detail
    EmployeePortalController-->>Employee: Show success

    HRHead->>RequestsController: POST /hr/requests/{id}/approve
    RequestsController->>RequestService: approve(requestId, reviewedBy)
    RequestService->>Database: UPDATE request status=HRApproved
    RequestsController-->>HRHead: Redirect with success

    BusinessOwner->>OwnerController: POST /owner/requests/{id}/approve
    OwnerController->>RequestService: ownerApprove(requestId, reviewedBy)
    RequestService->>Database: UPDATE request status=Approved
    alt Leave request
        RequestService->>Database: INSERT leave_ledger usage
    else Cash advance request
        RequestService->>Database: INSERT cash_advance_history
    end
    OwnerController-->>BusinessOwner: Redirect with success

    BusinessOwner->>OwnerController: POST /owner/requests/{id}/return
    OwnerController->>RequestService: ownerReturn(requestId, reviewedBy, note)
    RequestService->>Database: UPDATE request status=Returned, save owner note
    OwnerController-->>BusinessOwner: Redirect with success
